nanam\ncommercial area, surrounded by shoplots, banks, eateries, entertainment\noutlets, industrial zones,&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: large;\"\u003eclose proximity to\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: large;\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\"\u003eeducation hubs, government administration\ncomplexes, the hotel provides unmatched accessibility for both business and leisure\ntravellers.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi5zwIrqw6opPjb782F9RM4dtmm-dzSqlNY1CDgkzC9IESvkUXGOKSrNQ8sGaSZvS5C4WV243czEhTBRQ095Hcg3wQsW6xiFO9ds-mNF_-0VS2QNxI9XUU3gDLHzgfw-NHZb3zx1RmaV0Y-dWPv49gAO87rLaSzTd6Yw0kvhLfMQMxhWjXVXZSnayTejzoP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg data-original-height=\"302\" data-original-width=\"451\" height=\"428\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi5zwIrqw6opPjb782F9RM4dtmm-dzSqlNY1CDgkzC9IESvkUXGOKSrNQ8sGaSZvS5C4WV243czEhTBRQ095Hcg3wQsW6xiFO9ds-mNF_-0VS2QNxI9XUU3gDLHzgfw-NHZb3zx1RmaV0Y-dWPv49gAO87rLaSzTd6Yw0kvhLfMQMxhWjXVXZSnayTejzoP=w640-h428\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003ePhoto credit:&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://all.accor.com/hotel/8457/index.en.shtml?\" style=\"font-size: x-small; text-align: left;\"\u003eibis Styles Kota Kinabalu Inanam\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhvczy6YrjmOt9R4E1xyTVVAHOTw2awOH-mREaycQlYIdgz_FBlHIYqFNpHPqTaTWmwpe4so5l9wHLbsOkUPKlJtZI5T7J8uQjdAssTcuJ_ipwdwA2DHdzKd_dzkV4Ua6Tk2a5-SozrpgwOQ3Lb7tYad-J7C4xFcM9FrZyssubE9ZEWoX4cDxKTbHKE7fYr\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg data-original-height=\"301\" data-original-width=\"451\" height=\"428\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhvczy6YrjmOt9R4E1xyTVVAHOTw2awOH-mREaycQlYIdgz_FBlHIYqFNpHPqTaTWmwpe4so5l9wHLbsOkUPKlJtZI5T7J8uQjdAssTcuJ_ipwdwA2DHdzKd_dzkV4Ua6Tk2a5-SozrpgwOQ3Lb7tYad-J7C4xFcM9FrZyssubE9ZEWoX4cDxKTbHKE7fYr=w640-h428\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003ePhoto credit: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small; text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://all.accor.com/hotel/8457/index.en.shtml?\"\u003eibis Styles Kota Kinabalu Inanam\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eAs Kota Kinabalu’s first internationally\nbranded industrial rustic-inspired hotel, ibis Styles Kota Kinabalu Inanam\nstands out with its bold architecture, modern interiors, and welcoming\natmosphere. Designed for modern travellers, the hotel features 184 stylish\nguest rooms equipped with high-speed Wi-Fi, Sweet Beds by ibis Styles,\ncontemporary amenities, and calming industrial chic interiors. Room categories\nranging from Superior Queen and Twin to spacious Superior Suites cater\nperfectly to solo travellers, families, and corporate guests alike. \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eDining experiences at the hotel are equally\nappealing. Gabion Bistro serves all-day international and local cuisine\nalongside hearty buffet breakfasts, while ReBAR offers a relaxed environment\nfor evening gatherings. Guests can also unwind at the rooftop SkyDex, enjoying\npanoramic views of Kota Kinabalu’s skyline, surrounding greenery, and Sabah’s\nstunning sunsets.&nbsp;\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjAdMye0PXh4kOC73Bh21fNpLdV3JqaRCiHcKuUT4dV0HcpYp7JRjW0CbZBDoIHHIYN_cvPoBlTJYWqJ5OkeMAfMh9CIh6SC2QNIF3zofni3uSIO6IWJhbvtxET_amVOzNcDCgz6cPVUia75erwxlx0Pc7HTM87FdLPKE3E23bgT0x2J5Co927wMZf8LBTc\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg data-original-height=\"593\" data-original-width=\"891\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjAdMye0PXh4kOC73Bh21fNpLdV3JqaRCiHcKuUT4dV0HcpYp7JRjW0CbZBDoIHHIYN_cvPoBlTJYWqJ5OkeMAfMh9CIh6SC2QNIF3zofni3uSIO6IWJhbvtxET_amVOzNcDCgz6cPVUia75erwxlx0Pc7HTM87FdLPKE3E23bgT0x2J5Co927wMZf8LBTc=w640-h426\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003ePhoto credit: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small; text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://all.accor.com/hotel/8457/index.en.shtml?\"\u003eibis Styles Kota Kinabalu Inanam\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eStrategically positioned approximately 20\nminutes away from Kota Kinabalu International Airport (KKIA) as well as to Kota\nKinabalu city centre and Borneo's largest purpose-built, multi-function\nwaterfront complex, Sabah International Convention Centre (SICC), the hotel\noffers convenient proximity to major hospitals, education hubs, shopping malls,\nand key business districts. Its location also provides short travel distances\nto Sabah’s iconic landmarks and attractions, including Menara Tun Mustapha,\nMasjid Bandaraya Kota Kinabalu (floating mosque), Mari-Mari Cultural Village,\nKokol Hill, Kiulu White Water Rafting, Mount Kinabalu, Kundasang, Mantanani\nIsland access points, and Simpang Mengayau, Kudat—fondly known as the Tip of\nBorneo.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgakD6r1w2QvVBYy8BdN16TQ1r9fpUtmPSpjzPyoYqbyW46mHMUdp4dYN4KT6it0GP1eiPbCQcAeaATGr5RnyqhMVc3aiaOATymRDfRgL2l6dzsbesjAqpK5GIVVMcAzTv6ludmn3d8zUtEHKILZTdbDecvsN5Gg_z5PtBogQjGdnUx-r-EFGqaye8xZDGh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg data-original-height=\"590\" data-original-width=\"886\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgakD6r1w2QvVBYy8BdN16TQ1r9fpUtmPSpjzPyoYqbyW46mHMUdp4dYN4KT6it0GP1eiPbCQcAeaATGr5RnyqhMVc3aiaOATymRDfRgL2l6dzsbesjAqpK5GIVVMcAzTv6ludmn3d8zUtEHKILZTdbDecvsN5Gg_z5PtBogQjGdnUx-r-EFGqaye8xZDGh=w640-h426\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003ePhoto credit:\u003ca href=\"https://all.accor.com/hotel/8457/index.en.shtml?\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small; text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://all.accor.com/hotel/8457/index.en.shtml?\"\u003eibis Styles Kota Kinabalu Inanam\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eWith the newly upgraded road network directly\nin front of the hotel seamlessly connecting to the Pan Borneo Highway, ibis\nStyles Kota Kinabalu offers effortless access to Sabah’s northern and eastern\ncorridors, making travel to destinations such as Ranau, Sandakan, Kudat, and\nbeyond more efficient than ever.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eBeyond accommodation, the hotel also caters to\ncorporate meetings, government functions, social events, and lifestyle\ngatherings with versatile meeting spaces and attentive hospitality. Whether\nvisiting for business, educational purposes, adventure tourism, or a relaxing\ngetaway, ibis Styles Kota Kinabalu serves as more than just a stylish urban\nretreat, it is a strategic gateway to the very best of Sabah.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eibis Styles Kota Kinabalu, Stay Stylish, Stay\nConnected, and Discover Sabah with Ease.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003eFor more information, visit \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-MY\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://all.accor.com/hotel/8457/index.en.shtml?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_new\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: blue;\"\u003eibis Styles Kota Kinabalu Inanam\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003